      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but looking at the data more closely, doesn't it seem like a lot of that \"mixed\" evidence actually leans towards the idea that these programs just make it harder for people to find full-time work? like, if the benefits are high enough, isn't the economic reality just that it's a net negative for labor participation?",
